  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {反撃|はんげき}に{出|で}る (go on the counterattack)\n- {反撃|はんげき}を{開始|かいし}する (begin a counterattack)\n- {反撃|はんげき}に{転|てん}じる (turn to a counterattack)\n- {反撃|はんげき}の{機会|きかい} (opportunity to strike back)\n\nUSAGE:\nFrequently used in sports commentary (especially soccer, baseball, and martial arts), military history, and political debate. In sports, the phrase {反撃|はんげき}の{狼煙|のろし}を{上|あ}げる (raise the signal fire of counterattack) is a dramatic expression meaning to begin a comeback.",
